    <h2>About Our Town</h2>
    <p>Nestled in the heart of Ogeechee County, Georgia, Grace Hollow is a quiet Southern town founded in 1862 by Bartholomew Grace. Today, we’re best known for our long-standing traditions, front porch stories, and our most beloved resident: Miss Eleanor Grace.</p>

    <h2>Quick Facts</h2>
