    <h2>Points of Interest</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Grace & Sons General Store:</strong> Run by Tom Grace. Home to an eclectic wall of taxidermy!</li>
      <li><strong>Faye's Diner:</strong> Sheriff Abbott says you HAVE to try the cherry pie.</li>
      <li><strong>Covenant Church:</strong> Reverend Truett Grace hasn't been consistently preaching since his wife came down with a mysterious illness.</li>
      <li><strong>Fable Inn:</strong> Enjoy our 5 guest rooms! Room 1 hosts consultations with Eleanor Grace (inquire by calling the inn).</li>
      <li><strong>Grace Hollow Swamp:</strong> Do not enter without Eleanor's permission.</li>
    </ul>

